msgid "显示光环"
msgstr "Show aura"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/halo_display.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/halo_display.rst:9
msgid "在图像中检测到的对象周围绘制光晕,与边界框显示类似，但更具视觉冲击力。适用于突出显示重要对象。"
msgstr ""
"Draws a halo around detected objects in the image, similar to the bounding "
"box display, but with more visual impact.Suitable for highlighting important"
" objects."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/halo_display.rst:11
msgid "效果展示："
msgstr "Effect display:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/halo_display.rst:13
msgid "显示光环效果"
msgstr "Show halo effect"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/halo_display.rst:22
msgid "适用场景"
msgstr "Applicable scenarios"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/halo_display.rst:23
msgid "**目标检测可视化**：显示检测到的物体位置和类别"
msgstr ""
"**Object Detection Visualization**: Displays detected object locations and "
"categories"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/halo_display.rst:24
msgid "**监控系统**：实时标注监控画面中的目标"
msgstr ""
"**Monitoring system**: Mark targets in the monitoring screen in real time"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/halo_display.rst:25
msgid "**质量检测**：标注产品缺陷位置"
msgstr "**Quality Inspection**: Mark the location of product defects"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/halo_display.rst:26
msgid "**数据标注验证**：验证模型预测结果的准确性"
msgstr ""
"**Data annotation verification**: Verify the accuracy of model prediction "
"results"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/halo_display.rst:27
msgid "**演示和报告**：生成可视化结果用于展示"
msgstr ""
"**Presentation and Reporting**: Generate visual results for presentation"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/halo_display.rst:28
msgid "**调试分析**：辅助开发者理解模型输出"
msgstr "**Debug Analysis**: Assist developers in understanding model output"

